IndigoPlateau_Interior1_Text_Celio_1::
	.string "{PLAY_BGM MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}Welcome to POKéMON LEAGUE, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Allow me to introduce myself.\n"
	.string "I am WILL.\p"
	.string "I have trained all around the world,\n"
	.string "making my psychic POKéMON powerful.\p"
	.string "And, at last, I’ve been accepted into\n"
	.string "the ELITE FOUR.\p"
	.string "I can only keep getting better!\p"
	.string "Losing is not an option!$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior1_Text_Celio_2::
	.string "Even though I was defeated, I won’t\n"
	.string "change my course.\p"
	.string "I will continue battling until I\n"
	.string "stand above all trainers!\p"
	.string "Now, {PLAYER}, move on and experience\n"
	.string "the true ferocity of the ELITE FOUR.$"

IndigoPlateau_Interior1_Text_CelioDefeat::
	.string "I... I can’t...\n"
	.string "believe it...$"
